{"segs": ["PA_ja_132:0.2", "PA_ja_132:0.3"], "en": "The First Book, Chapter on Non-Generosity (Asampadānavagga)", "model": "mitra-v4", "translated_at": "2026-11-27T12:51:25Z"},
